WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.950
First: an application runs in
Oracle Cloud Infrastructure.

3
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.400
How does the guide reach it?

4
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.350
The answer is a: through a connector
group in that cloud's network,

5
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:15.150
with line of sight to the application,
as for an on-premises one.

6
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.126
Second: in what order does
Learn protect service

7
00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:21.325
principal names with the
domain controller sensor?

8
00:00:21.325 --> 00:00:24.966
The answer is b:
application S P N's first,

9
00:00:24.966 --> 00:00:29.062
the D C's own S P N later,
to avoid admin lockout.

10
00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:34.030
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
